<title>JAPAN: Sekisui Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sekisui Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		397.55		vs	  351.13</p>
<p> Operating	   18.62		vs	   12.15</p>
<p> Current	     20.85		vs	   17.74</p>
<p> Net		   11.30		vs	    7.54</p>
<p> EPS		   20.46 yen	  vs	   13.67 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    552 million	  vs	 552 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sekisui Chemical Co Ltd is a major chemical maker and resin processor.</p>
</text>
